---
// Components Imports
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"
import CourseworkSection from "../components/CourseworkSection.astro"
import { coursework } from "../data/coursework"
---
<Layout title="Home - Andres Perez">
    <div slot="main" id="frame-div">
        <div id="main-div" class="m-0 p-0">
            <div id="textblock-div">
                <h1 id="header-tag">Hey Welcome! 👋</h1>
                <p> My name is Andres Perez, a computer engineering student with a minor in mathematics at 
                    the University of Notre Dame. Born and raised in Long Beach, California, I am the first 
                    in my family to go to college, and I have dedicated myself to become a bit better everyday. 
                    My current interests lie in embedded systems, FPGAs, mathematics and everything low-level! 
                </p>

                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-6 mb-4">
                    <div class="flex-1">
                        <p>Currently, I'm:</p>
                        <ul class="indent-4 list-disc list-inside my-2">
                            <li>
                                Committing my time to IrishSat as the Electronics Lead for the GOAT 
                                subteam, where I'm leading development on our Helmholtz cage project
                                and organzing development for a new ground station antenna! 
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Authoring the CREATE Newsletter for the Center for Career Development 
                                (If you're an ND Alumni and want to be feature, feel free to reach out!)
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Looking forward to my summer 2026 hardware internship at NVIDIA! 
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="w-full md:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4">
                        <img 
                            id="main-image" 
                            src="/brand/aperez26_headshot.jpg" 
                            alt="Andres Perez Headshot" 
                            class="rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full h-auto object-cover"
                            loading="lazy"
                        >
                    </div>
                </div> 
                
                <p> Beyond the classroom, I enjoy working out, playing chess and billiards, and chipping alway at learning Japanese! 
                    僕の日本語は下手ですが、毎日勉強しています。I love talking about musicals, robotics, space and the following the 
                    developments in AI! 
                </p>
            </div>

            <CourseworkSection semesters={coursework} showMinors={true} />
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>